uestion other than the empty-plan and the which-dish question), with unnecessary_question_rate (target at most 0.2). change_path: reader_calls, picker_calls (each picker model call), picker_attempts and frame_ignored over every run of every scenario; an \"other\" reply's reader call, which no run records, is counted from the turn. must_violations counts must lines (one fault gives one line where cheap: a locked dish removed is said by the locked check only, and the allowed-changes findings share one line); must_violation_scenarios counts scenarios. Only the judged turn is must-checked: with button_after, the follow-up before the button is not (its shown texts are, as every shown text of the thread is).",
